Re-scope AI, telemetry, and update settings to MACHINE level

Pedagog exam environment requires that students cannot override these
settings via User/settings.json. Changing the scope to MACHINE ensures
the values set in Machine/settings.json are enforced server-side and
are not overridable by the student.

Settings changed:
- chat.disableAIFeatures: WINDOW -> MACHINE
- telemetry.telemetryLevel: APPLICATION -> MACHINE
- update.mode: APPLICATION -> MACHINE

